msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about the goya burger at Smile Burger in Downtown Ryukyu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "The goya burger? Yes, I've heard of it. What about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Apparently you can only get it here in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Oh, really? I think I did hear something about that. I never saw those "
"burgers on the menu when I lived in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"I was so used to seeing them here, I guess I forgot about that. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I suppose that means I've gotten used to living in Okinawa, hehehe... Good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I heard the rafute soba over at the Okinawan Soba place in the Kariyushi "
"Arcade is really delicious, and rich in collagen, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Oh, I've heard of that. It's at that little shop in front of the entrance to"
" the Public Market, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"I go there to eat with one of my bodyboarding friends every now and then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Yup! It tastes even better after a long day out on the waves. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about the \"legendary\" appetizer they have at Aqua Sky in "
"Hatsumachi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"A legendary appetizer? Well, since we're in Okinawa... would it be something"
" like tofuyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "It's actually just salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Salt? Hold on... You mean, like, salt and pepper, salt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's a special salt that's only made in Okinawa. It has a hint of "
"sweetness to it, too, which supposedly brings out the flavor in alcoholic "
"drinks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Wow... So their \"legendary\" appetizer is just salt. That's really\r\n"
"classy. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of Tantakatan? It's a kind of shochu made with red "
"perilla."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Tantakatan? Kiryu-san, how did you know what my favorite kind of alcohol is?"
" <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Oh, it is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Yes! I love to drink Tantakatan with cranberry juice. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"It's so smooth... I always end up drinking way too much. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

