msgctxt "760"
msgid "Have you ever had the goya burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"I have! One of my coworkers bought one for me once. It was a little bitter, "
"but sooo delicious. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "I liked it, even though I'm not a big fan of goya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Have you heard about the rafute soba at Okinawan Soba?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"It's full of collagen, right? I've definitely noticed that the day after I "
"eat their rafute soba, my skin feels a lot smoother. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"They say lots of Okinawan foods are good for your health. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> And they're delicious, too⑬what could be better "
"than that? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Have you heard of the \"legendary\" appetizer they've got over at Aqua Sky?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Oh, that rare salt, right? I asked my friend about it, but they won't have "
"any until next year, apparently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Oh, is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"So we're going to have to wait until next year... Guess we'll have to be "
"patient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Have you heard of Tantakatan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "You mentioned that before, right? Do you like it too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Yeah, it's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"That's something we have in common, then. Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"I'm glad we've got the same taste in alcohol. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> "
"Maybe we should go drinking together sometime! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

